 response, confidence, and audit records.</p><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-md text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-700\">Currently accepting pilot applications - Virginia and East Coast schools.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600\">Contact:<!-- --> <a class=\"font-medium text-slate-950 transition hover:text-valkor-orange\" href=\"mailto:jackson@valkorsystems.com\">jackson@valkorsystems.com</a></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 lg:justify-end\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 transition hover:text-slate-950\" href=\"/pilot\">Pilot Program</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 transition hover:text-slate-950\" href=\"/trust-center\">Trust Center</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 transition hover:text-slate-950\" href=\"/it-security\">IT &amp; Security</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 transition hover:text-slate-950\" href=\"/resources\">Resources</a></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-7xl border-t border-slate-200/80 pt-6 text-sm text-slate-500\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Valkor Systems. All rights reserved.</div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-72c1bf8cb8877324.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1725,[\\\"724\\\",\\\"static/chunks/724-cf65792c48e33df3.js\\\",\\\"725\\\",\\\"static/chunks/725-102a69bb248c73da.js\\\",\\\"752\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/resources/page-e4b4c03c0a1c54b5.js\\\"],\\\"Header\\\"]\\n5:I[2619,[\\\"724\\\",\\\"static/chunks/724-cf65792c48e33df3.js\\\",\\\"725\\\",\\\"static/chunks/725-102a69bb248c73da.js\\\",\\\"752\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/resources/page-e4b4c03c0a1c54b5.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nd:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/e4af272ccee01ff0-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\